WEBVTT

00:07:59.590 --> 00:08:01.900
with the policemen
dragging it to the police car,

00:08:01.924 --> 00:08:05.123
that was the best day
for newspaper photographers

00:08:05.147 --> 00:08:06.374
that they will ever have.

00:08:06.851 --> 00:08:09.068
So, I mean, these are
the things you can do.

00:08:09.092 --> 00:08:10.491
And you can always use humor.

00:08:10.515 --> 00:08:12.790
There is also one big thing about humor,

00:08:12.814 --> 00:08:14.093
it really hurts.

00:08:14.117 --> 00:08:17.709
Because these guys really are
taking themselves too seriously.

00:08:18.250 --> 00:08:20.106
When you start to mock them, it hurts.

00:08:21.393 --> 00:08:25.019
Now, everybody is talking
about His Majesty, the Internet,

00:08:25.043 --> 00:08:26.866
and it is also a very useful skill.

00:08:27.279 --> 00:08:31.414
But don't rush to label things
like "a Facebook Revolution,"